IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BGLQ.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PST-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-PST-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL
        ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
        FILE STATUS IS WS-PST-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD PST-FILE.
01 PST-LINE PIC X(300).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PST-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-PST-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-EOF PIC X(01).
01 WS-TAG PIC X(04).
01 WS-GL PIC X(10).
01 WS-DC PIC X(01).
01 WS-AMT PIC X(30).
01 WS-ENTITY PIC X(20).
01 WS-CUR PIC X(03).
01 WS-JRN PIC X(20).
01 WS-DATE PIC X(08).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-FILTER PIC X(20).
01 LS-MATCH-COUNT PIC 9(06).
01 LS-RC PIC X(02).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-FILTER LS-MATCH-COUNT LS-RC.
    MOVE 0 TO LS-MATCH-COUNT
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-PST-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/journal/postings.log"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-PST-PATH
    OPEN INPUT PST-FILE
    IF WS-PST-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "35" TO LS-RC
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE "N" TO WS-EOF
    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = "Y"
        READ PST-FILE
            AT END MOVE "Y" TO WS-EOF
            NOT AT END PERFORM FILTER-LINE
        END-READ
    END-PERFORM
    CLOSE PST-FILE
    GOBACK.

FILTER-LINE.
    IF PST-LINE(1:4) NOT = "GLP|"
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-TAG WS-GL WS-DC WS-AMT WS-ENTITY WS-CUR
        WS-JRN WS-DATE
    UNSTRING PST-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
        INTO WS-TAG WS-GL WS-DC WS-AMT WS-ENTITY WS-CUR WS-JRN WS-DATE
    END-UNSTRING
    IF LS-FILTER NOT = SPACES AND LS-FILTER NOT = WS-ENTITY
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    ADD 1 TO LS-MATCH-COUNT
    DISPLAY "gl=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-GL)
        " dc=" WS-DC
        " amount=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-AMT)
        " entity=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-ENTITY)
        " currency=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CUR)
        " journal=" FUNCTION TRIM(WS-JRN)
        " date=" WS-DATE.
